1	<!DOCTYPE html>
2	<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
3	<head>
4		<meta charset="utf-8">
5		<meta http-equiv="content-security-policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
6		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
7		<meta name="description" content="A well-structured, accessible HTML5 document with modern best practices.">
8		<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
9		<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
10		<meta name="theme-color" content="#121212" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
11		<title>Welcome</title>
12		<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E👋%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
13		<style>
14			:root {
15				color-scheme: light dark;
16				--text: #1a1a1a;
17				--text-secondary: #555;
18				--background: #fff;
19				--surface: #fff;
20				--accent: #0052a3;
21				--border: #e0e0e0;
22			}
23			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
24				:root {
25					--text: #e0e0e0;
26					--text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
27					--background: #121212;
28					--surface: #1e1e1e;
29					--accent: #5fa3ff;
30					--border: #333;
31				}
32			}
33			*,
34			*::before,
35			*::after {
36				box-sizing: border-box;
37			}
38			html {
39				-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
40				text-size-adjust: 100%;
41			}
42			@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
43				html {
44					scroll-behavior: smooth;
45				}
46				a {
47					transition: text-decoration-thickness 0.15s ease;
48				}
49				.skip-link {
50					transition: transform 0.15s ease;
51				}
52				button,
53				.button {
54					transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
55				}
56			}
57			body {
58				display: grid;
59				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
60				grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
61				min-height: 100vh;
62				min-height: 100dvh;
63				font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
64				font-size: 1rem;
65				line-height: 1.6;
66				overflow-wrap: break-word;
67				max-width: 70ch;
68				margin: 0 auto;
69				padding-top: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-top));
70				padding-right: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-right));
71				padding-bottom: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
72				padding-left: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-left));
73				color: var(--text);
74				background: var(--background);
75			}
76			h1 {
77				color: var(--accent);
78				font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.25rem + 3vw, 2.5rem);
79				font-weight: 700;
80				line-height: 1.1;
81				text-wrap: balance;
82				margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
83				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
84			}
85			h2 {
86				color: var(--accent);
87				font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.5vw, 1.75rem);
88				font-weight: 600;
89				line-height: 1.2;
90				text-wrap: balance;
91				margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
92				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
93			}
94			h2:first-child {
95				margin-top: 0;
96			}
97			p {
98				text-wrap: pretty;
99				margin: 1rem 0;
100				line-height: 1.65;
101			}
102			a {
103				color: var(--accent);
104				text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
105				text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
106				text-decoration-skip-ink: auto;
107				font-weight: 500;
108			}
109			a:hover, a:active {
110				text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
111			}
112			button,
113			.button {
114				display: inline-block;
115				text-decoration: none;
116				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
117				font-size: 1rem;
118				font-weight: 500;
119				font-family: inherit;
120				color: var(--background);
121				background: var(--accent);
122				border: 2px solid var(--accent);
123				border-radius: 0.25rem;
124				cursor: pointer;
125				white-space: nowrap;
126			}
127			button:hover,
128			.button:hover {
129				opacity: 0.85;
130				text-decoration: none;
131			}
132			button:active,
133			.button:active {
134				transform: scale(0.97);
135			}
136			ul, ol {
137				margin: 1rem 0;
138				padding-left: 2rem;
139			}
140			li {
141				margin: 0.5rem 0;
142			}
143			:focus-visible {
144				outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
145				outline-offset: 2px;
146			}
147			a:not(.button):focus-visible {
148				border-radius: 2px;
149			}
150			.skip-link {
151				position: absolute;
152				left: 0;
153				top: 0;
154				transform: translateY(-100%);
155				background: var(--accent);
156				color: var(--background);
157				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
158				z-index: 1000;
159				border-radius: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
160				font-weight: 600;
161				text-decoration: none;
162				display: inline-block;
163			}
164			.skip-link:focus {
165				transform: none;
166				outline: 3px solid var(--text);
167				outline-offset: -3px;
168			}
169			header {
170				padding-block: 1.5rem 0;
171			}
172			main {
173				padding: 1rem 0;
174			}
175			main:focus {
176				outline: none;
177			}
178			section {
179				margin: 2rem 0;
180				scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem;
181			}
182			@media (forced-colors: active) {
183				.skip-link,
184				button,
185				.button {
186					border: 2px solid ButtonText;
187				}
188			}
189			.card {
190				border: 1px solid var(--border);
191				border-radius: 0.5rem;
192				padding: 1.5rem;
193				background: var(--surface);
194				margin: 1.5rem 0;
195			}
196			.card h3 {
197				font-size: 1.25rem;
198				line-height: 1.3;
199				text-wrap: balance;
200				margin-top: 0;
201				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
202				color: var(--accent);
203			}
204			.visually-hidden {
205				position: absolute;
206				width: 1px;
207				height: 1px;
208				margin: -1px;
209				padding: 0;
210				overflow: hidden;
211				clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
212				white-space: nowrap;
213				border: 0;
214			}
215			@media (prefers-contrast: more) {
216				:root {
217					--border: currentColor;
218				}
219				button,
220				.button {
221					border-width: 3px;
222				}
223				.card {
224					border-width: 2px;
225				}
226			}
227			footer {
228				padding-block: 1.5rem;
229				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
230				font-size: 0.875rem;
231				color: var(--text-secondary);
232				text-align: center;
233			}
234			footer p {
235				margin: 0.5rem 0;
236			}
237			small {
238				display: block;
239			}
240			@media print {
241				:root {
242					color-scheme: light;
243					--text: #000;
244					--text-secondary: #333;
245					--background: #fff;
246					--surface: #fff;
247					--accent: #000;
248					--border: #999;
249				}
250				.skip-link,
251				button,
252				.button {
253					display: none;
254				}
255				body {
256					display: block;
257					min-height: 0;
258					max-width: none;
259					padding: 0;
260				}
261				a {
262					color: inherit;
263					text-decoration: underline;
264				}
265				a[href^="http"]::after {
266					content: " (" attr(href) ")";
267					font-size: 0.85em;
268					font-weight: normal;
269				}
270				.card {
271					border: none;
272					break-inside: avoid;
273				}
274			}
275		</style>
276	</head>
277	<body>
278		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
279		<header>
280			<h1>Welcome</h1>
281		</header>
282		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
283			<section aria-label="Introduction">
284				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
285				<p>
286					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
287					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
288				</p>
289				<p>
290					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
291					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
292				</p>
293			</section>
294	
295			<section aria-labelledby="features">
296				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
297				<ul>
298					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
299					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
300					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
301					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
302					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
303					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
304				</ul>
305			</section>
306	
307			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
308				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
309				<article class="card">
310					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
311					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
312					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
313				</article>
314	
315				<article class="card">
316					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
317					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. The “Learn more” button above demonstrates smooth transitions and proper visual feedback.</p>
318					<p>Try using the Tab key to navigate through all interactive elements.</p>
319				</article>
320			</section>
321	
322			<section aria-labelledby="resources">
323				<h2 id="resources">Resources</h2>
324				<p>Want to learn more about web accessibility and semantic HTML? Check out these resources:</p>
325				<ul>
326					<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/quickref/">WCAG 2.2 Quick Reference</a></li>
327					<li><a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/">HTML Living Standard</a></li>
328					<li><a href="https://www.a11y-101.com/">A11y 101</a></li>
329				</ul>
330			</section>
331		</main>
332		<footer>
333			<p><small>&copy; <time datetime="2026">2026</time>. All rights reserved.</small></p>
334		</footer>
335	</body>
336	</html>
